            <desc_content>
                <paragraph>Returns the <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.builds" refuri="hydra_zen.builds#hydra_zen.builds"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">builds</literal></reference> function, but with customized default values.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>E.g. <literal>make_custom_builds_fn(hydra_convert='all')</literal> will return a version
                    of the <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.builds" refuri="hydra_zen.builds#hydra_zen.builds"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">builds</literal></reference> function where the default value for <literal>hydra_convert</literal>
                    is <literal>'all'</literal> instead of <literal>None</literal>.</paragraph>
